  "title": "John Rogerson’s quay",
  "html_source": "<p><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sir_John_Rogerson&#x27;s_Quay\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Sir John Rogerson’s quay</a> is a street and quay in Dublin on the south bank of the Liffey between City Quay in the west and Britain Quay. Formerly part of Dublin Port, it has some of the few remaining campshire warehouses in Dublin.</p>",
